Description:
 libmakemkv - Shared library for MakeMKV.
 makemkv-bin - MakeMKV command-line tools.
 mmccextr   - Closed Caption extractor for MakeMKV.
 mmgplsrv   - MakeMKV GPL Server used for decrypting DVDs by MakeMKV CLI.
 reel       - DVD and Blu-ray ripping tool.
 reel-common - Common files for reel.
 reel-gtk   - GTK Frontend for makemkvcon written in Python.
 reel-qt    - Qt Frontend for makemkvcon written in Python.
